      "id": "standard:xaman-connect-lifecycle",
      "type": "standard",
      "status": "active",
      "statement": "All migrated XRBitcoinCash wallet pages use the same Xaman connection lifecycle: browser authorizeAndWarm from the deliberate click with read-only readiness in parallel; connection never creates a transaction; one attempt/generation at a time; visible Cancel / restart while connecting; 180-second hard timeout cleanup; no automatic replacement authorization; xApp uses its supplied account; remembered public account is not signing readiness; pending transaction guards survive reset."
    },
